 "hook": "Pleiades, “a community-built gazetteer and graph of ancient places,” has collected data on 40,000+ settlements, roads, rivers, monuments, and many other types of landmarks. It also describes the relationships between them — linking, for instance, the Parthenon to the Acropolis and the Acropolis to Athens.",
